 \"Known prior inability or unavailability to complete required study visits during study participation\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"Significant peripheral edema as per investigator's discretion\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"OR\": {\n                                        \"left\": {\n                                          \"raw_text\": \"A psychiatric condition (e.g., suicidal ideation) or chronic alcohol or drug abuse problem, determined from the patient's medical history, which, in the opinion of the investigator, may pose a threat to patient compliance\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          \"OR\": {\n                                            \"left\": {\n                                              \"raw_text\": \"Use of a platelet-derived growth factor within 28 days before screening\"\n                                            },\n                                            \"right\": {\n                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                \"left\": {\n                                                  \"raw_text\": \"Use of any investigational drug or therapy within 28 days before screening\"\n                                                },\n                                                \"right\": {\n                                                  \"raw_text\": \"Has any other factor which may, in the opinion of the investigator, compromise participation and/or follow-up in the study\"\n                                                }\n                                              }\n    